{
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
  "leadInSeconds": 0.4,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "text": "Imagine spending four hundred dollars on a machine\u2026 just to discover your hands could do the same thing.",
      "emotion": "suspense",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 0.45,
      "duration": 5.424,
      "end": 5.874,
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "dream",
      "text": "Meet Juicero. A startup that wanted to revolutionize fresh juice. The idea? A sophisticated, internet-connected machine that squeezed specially prepared produce packs. The pitch was simple: fresh juice, without the mess.",
      "emotion": "excitement",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 7.35,
      "duration": 14.232,
      "end": 21.582,
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "millions",
      "text": "Investors poured approximately one hundred and twenty million dollars into the company. The machine launched at six hundred and ninety-nine dollars, before the price was reduced. It looked like the future of breakfast.",
      "emotion": "confidence",
      "rate": "+13%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 22.8,
      "duration": 10.536,
      "end": 33.336,
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "reveal-a",
      "text": "Then Bloomberg tested something nobody wanted to admit. The juice packs could be squeezed by hand\u2026 and the machine wasn't necessary for the basic result.",
      "emotion": "suspense",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 36.05,
      "duration": 8.568,
      "end": 44.618,
      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "reveal-b",
      "text": "To be fair, Juicero promised consistency, convenience, and freshness checks. But the internet only saw the hands.",
      "emotion": "seriousness",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 47.45,
      "duration": 7.176,
      "end": 54.626,
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "collapse",
      "text": "The backlash was brutal. Juicero offered refunds and suspended sales in September twenty seventeen. The company shut down.",
      "emotion": "concern",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 56.25,
      "duration": 8.088,
      "end": 64.338,
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "text": "And this is where developers should pay attention. We sometimes spend weeks building complex systems, AI features, and beautiful dashboards\u2026 when the customer simply wants their problem solved.",
      "emotion": "dramatic",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 67.85,
      "duration": 11.64,
      "end": 79.49,
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "text": "So before you build the next big thing, ask yourself: would the customer still need it without the fancy technology?",
      "emotion": "reflection",
      "rate": "+9%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 80.65,
      "duration": 6.696,
      "end": 87.346,
      "words": 20
    }
  ],
